title: $:/themes/tiddlywiki/quietude/sticky
tags: [[$:/tags/Stylesheet]]
code-body: yes

<!-- When sticky titles are enabled, vanilla gives the title an opaque
     background (tiddler-background). This theme's leaf is transparent — the
     page shows through — so the stuck title takes the page colour instead,
     and gains the bottom hairline it otherwise doesn't have, without which
     body text would scroll invisibly beneath it. Only emitted while sticky
     titles are switched on. -->
<$reveal state="$:/themes/tiddlywiki/vanilla/options/stickytitles" type="match" text="yes">
``
.tc-story-river .tc-tiddler-title {
	background: <<colour page-background>>;
	border-bottom: 1px solid var(--q-line);
	padding-bottom: var(--q-space-2xs);
}
``
</$reveal>
